RequestUnstake_Lido_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when stETHAmount zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when stETHAmount non zero
   ├── given vault has not approved adapter on stETH
   │  └── it should revert on transferFrom
   └── given vault approved adapter on stETH
      ├── it should pull stETH from vault
      ├── it should approve the withdrawal queue
      ├── it should mint a withdrawal NFT to the vault
      ├── it should reset queue allowance to zero
      └── it should return the new requestId
